NAME
       httpd - minimal HTTP server

SYNOPSIS
       httpd [port] [file]

DESCRIPTION
       Serves a single file, or a built-in page when no file is given,
       on the chosen port (8080 by default). Runs until interrupted.

EXAMPLES
       httpd
       httpd 8080 /mnt/index.html

SEE ALSO
       nc(1), curl(1), wget(1)
